---
description: ScrapeSmith scraper generation workflow
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first; it is the source of truth for this repository.

- Generate: `python scripts/build.py "<url>" --json --out ./bundles/<site>`
- Scaffold for manual work: `python scripts/scaffold_bundle.py <dir>`
- Validate: `python scripts/validate_bundle.py <dir>`
- Keep `polite` mode unless the user explicitly allows otherwise.
- Never commit `.env`, `data/`, or `proxies.json`.
- Definition of done: validation exits 0, at least one mapped record, and no
  secrets were added.
